Student Résumé Outcome
Improved digital access and engagement for senior adults, volunteers, donors, and community supporters by designing and developing a modern, accessible nonprofit website using stakeholder requirements engineering, user-centered design, information architecture, responsive web development, accessibility standards, REST API integration, usability testing, GitHub, and collaborative software engineering.

